      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "假如她那令人“深刻印象”的表现，\n能让大树快车以力量及速度将其压制……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2691c60d63a0be4b5cf0048d5734d1f71ece57b2c84ca026a5961ad18cf44564",
